          "headline": "Trump says the US no longer needs a deal with Iran; oil prices jump",
          "summary": "President Trump wrote on Truth Social on Thursday that the time for a deal with Tehran had passed, saying the US holds Iran's money and the Strait of Hormuz. Brent crude rose about 1.6% to $94.25 a barrel after the post, reversing an earlier fall on hopes for talks. Iran's foreign minister Abbas Araghchi says Iran's offer to reopen Hormuz within two days still stands if the war ends on all fronts.",
