          "summary": "The Liberia-flagged crude tanker MT Dominica Prosperity was struck by a projectile on Wednesday while drifting off Mina Saqr port in Ras Al Khaimah, UAE. The UAE Coast Guard evacuated all 22 crew, including 19 Indians, with no injuries, Shipping Minister Sarbananda Sonowal said. A Saudi-flagged tanker, NCC Fajr, with three Indians aboard, was also in a possible attack in the Strait of Hormuz the same day. Nobody has said who fired.",
